  (text "NOTES\nU3: 1 MHz, 4 A\nC11: hot-loop cap: closest to VIN/PGND\nL1: height <=3.1 mm; alternative: Wurth WE-XHMI 4030\nR14: Vout = 1.0 V x (1 + 100/24) = 5.17 V\nC17: optional feed-forward (datasheet 9.2.2.8)\nR16: EN UVLO: 6.40 V on / 5.88 V off\nC34: at U3 EN: R15/R16 sit by Q7 (layout v2), EN_5V is a ~30 mm In2 node; 19.6k x 2.2n = 43 us\nQ7: LTC2955 EN-bar high (off) -> 5 V buck off\nU4: HAT back-power rule: Pi USB-C cannot feed into the HAT 5 V buck\nQ3: 30 V, low Rds(on); ideal-diode FET\nD3: HAT 5 V buck running" (at 15 92.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid cbfef2f0-0494-5417-b19f-9d93784e3efd))
)
